  "articleBody": "Building a detached ADU can be an exciting project, but it's easy to stumble into common traps if you're not careful. We've seen it all, and believe me, a little foresight goes a long way in saving you headaches, time, and money. Knowing what to watch out for can make all the difference in achieving the ADU of your dreams in Los Angeles.",
